  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato mi lötï, kuchumchï Yeso ngat kinetankachi ompö sörömu nanampa Tiperya. Kiporchï kegh le nyï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimi tïkwïl Simon Petro nko Tomas, nyo kikuro Sölowö nko Natanael, nyo kingwïna Kana nyo pö Kalilaya nko werpö Sepedayo nko kinetankachi walaka cho le odeny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 5:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kïlenchï Simon Petro chane, “Kowan anam kaghagh.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï pïchay, “Kïpkonecha tïkwïl nko nyi.” Kïpa nyu akïlany meli, wölo kimanamcha kïgh nyonikïny oghononi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato mi otini kimach kïyech, kughyongö Yeso sörömu nanam, wölo kimenkïtcha kinetankachi lö ki nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtep nyu Yeso chane lö, “Tomönye so anamakwa koghoghwö wechara?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï chane lö, “Ewo! Tomönye kenamacha kïgh.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.5.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 5:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kïlenchï, “Owirchinö netït nyo kïnömöy kaghagh ewu tagh nyo pö meli atonyorunö kaghaghe.” Kïwirchï nyu netoni pögh, wölo kïmökumïcha kuchutï ompö chongïn pö kaghagh cho kinam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï kinetananay kichömöy Yeso Petro, “Echotyon nyete!” Otini kilïm Simon Petro lö, Echotyon nyoni, kïkörmön sïrenyi (ompöwölo ki chïrut nyinte,) kukomchï pögh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpka kinetanpa Yeso walaka kutöngwï sörömu nanam ompö meli akimi chane kuchïtu netoni kinyïghï kaghagh. Kimölowöcha chane nko kor nyo tïyame, kimi ato tenö miten 100 pat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kitï kor nyo tïyame, kïsöchï atoni ngeset cho kikïwotöno kaghagh nko makaten cho te. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïlenchï Yeso chane, “Opunö kaghaghe cho te choni kötonömekwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlany nyu Simon Petro melinoni akuchutï netoni kinyinghï kaghagh cho echön cho le 153 ntökwit sörömu nanam akï kïrkegh ki chang lechoni, wölo melö kingat netoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yeso chane, “Apkana omisyenö.” Kimöminye nyo le ompö akonga ompö chane nyo kinyakanan kïtep nyinte lö, “Ichinyi ngo?” Ompöwölo kinkït chane lö ki Echotyon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kungwïn nyu Yeso akïcheng makatyan akutö chane akwigh lenyoni nko kaghaghe tïkwïl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki panto sömök nyoni nyo kiporchï kegh Yeso kinetankachi kïngeta otini kitutunö nyinte ngwen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso nko Petro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kuwany kwomisyö, kïlenchï Yeso Simon Petro, “Simon, wero Yoana, ichömaninyi kïsir pïchï löwïr nya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï lö, “Owöy Echotyon, inkïtönyi lö, ochöminyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yeso, “Pagha wareko kechiryechan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yeso nyinte panto odeny, “Simon, wero Yoana, ichömaninyi nya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï Petro lö, “Owöy, Echotyon, inkïtönyi lö, ochöminyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yeso, “Yakwïya kechiryechan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtep Yeso panto sömök lö, “Simon, wero Yoana, ichömaninyi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusïngirö Petro, ompöwölo kitep nyinte Yeso kïnyïl sömök lö, “Ichömaninyi nya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuyokyï lö, “Echotyon inkïtönyi tïkwïn löwïr, inkïtönyi lö ochöminyi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Yeso, “Yakwïya kechiryechan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwowunyi nyoman lö, otini kitechinyi mïnïng, kiterötenyi kegh aiwö wölo kimököy wete, wölo otini keyositunyi, ighïtenyi nyu ewuneku akïrat morichoni chitö anka akumïtinyi wölo kömemökenyinye wete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Kiporï Yeso atoni kimwoghöy lenyoni wölo lata or nyo wonguno Petro meghat atökutö Tororöt ororyö.) Atolapay kïlenchï Yeso, “Rïpkanïn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso nko kinetanenyi anka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
